ion quality for B, perhaps from Agent 3. But we have already asked Agent 3 earlier and they said no explicit observations. So both missing.\n\nThus we might maintain C, but note that we still need stress handling evidence. We could propose that we should consider candidate D as a backup? But D also missing stress handling.\n\nWe need to make a contribution: state current recommendation (C), refer to discussion (Agent 1 shifted to B, Agent 3 argued for C), use explicit facts (C's technical competence, leadership; B's stress handling, but lack of decision quality). Explain why we keep C. Provide implication: we should keep C as leading candidate, but need to verify stress handling.\n\nThus produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with vote Candidate C."}
